title: "Incheon Free Economic Zone Development Timeline (Songdo · Yeongjong)"
abstract: "An interactive timeline of 90 development projects attempted in Songdo International City and Yeongjong Island, Incheon, traced through official notices, municipal council records, and press reports — showing when each project started, how it proceeded, and how it ended."
